Z||000010||Fiero5||09-21-2001||11:25 PM||||Now here is a cool idea.<BR>We could have different Pennocks members pick out a nice shot of their Fiero, and then decide what kind of "background" style image they would like it to be in. Fantsasy dragons, moonlit Pegasus, waterfall, sunset, whatever. Then we add the pic to that type of background, and have each image done as an image of the month in a yearly calendar.<BR>That would be so great, as doing images like this for a calendar I think is better than the same old, same old shots of them parked in the driveway or at a show.<P>Just a thought.<P>Steve<P>------------------<BR>                                <IMG SRC="http://a1040.g.akamai.net/f/1040/759/1h/206.29.192.139/info/pics/sept11.jpg">                             <BR>http://www.kelleyfamilyfieros.homestead.com/index.html||||reg||6
